[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Move My Setup to Another Computer
GenericName=Take your apps, desktop look and files to a new computer
Comment=Pack your apps, choices, desktop look and files into a folder, then bring them in on another Secure Linux computer. Passwords and keys never move.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/secure-linux-move-setup
Icon=document-export
Terminal=true
Categories=System;Utility;
Keywords=move;new computer;transfer;copy setup;migrate;bring over;
